Package: MVCens
Title: Matrix-Variate Models for Censored, Skewed, and Heavy-Tailed Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Atila", "Correia", , "atilapc1989@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description:  Provides simulation and likelihood-based estimation procedures
    for matrix-variate statistical models with emphasis on censored,
    incomplete, skewed, and heavy-tailed data. The package implements
    unified interfaces for random generation and ECM-based maximum
    likelihood estimation of matrix-variate normal, skew-normal,
    row skew-normal, skew-t, normal-inverse Gaussian, variance-gamma,
    and censored matrix-variate models. It is intended for applications
    involving matrix-valued observations such as longitudinal studies,
    spatio-temporal data, environmental monitoring, financial panels,
    and other structured multivariate datasets.
